                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "An old friend gifted this to me out of nowhere and i was confused at first. But everything changed after i played it. It's basically a FPS shooter with a very nice PS1 ashetic where memorisation of the level and enemy patterns is essential if you want to survive or you are gonna die over and over. So if you like smaller scale challenging fps games that test your knowledge of the level it's a pretty good time. There were some bs parts where i died because of things out of control but even so, i still had fun.",
